    "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n- Upgraded cashu-ts from v3.5 to v4.3.0\r\n- Number-typed amount boundary: introduces `AppMintQuote` / `AppMeltQuote` types and conversion helpers (`amountToNumber`, `toProofs`, `toMeltQuote`) at the store boundary so the rest of the app continues to work with number amounts.\r\n- Shared `CounterSource`: a single ephemeral counter source is shared across wallet instances, with countersReserved events persisting advances to localStorage immediately. This replaces the old manual counter pre-bump/rollback workaround for melt operations and adds `retryOnceOnSignedOutputs` as a safety net.\r\n- Type fixes in touched paths: removes `as any` casts encountered during the migration; properly types `StoredMint`, `WalletProof`, `DexieProofRow`.\r\n- Fixes latent restore bug where restore never advanced the keyset counter, causing \"outputs already signed\" errors on the next operation until repeated +10 bumps caught up.\r\n- Removes dead (disabled) Token v3 code\r\n- Housekeeping: removes dead `src/boot/cashu.js` and its Quasar boot entry; excludes @cashu/cashu-ts from Vite dep optimizer (ESM + BigInt); adds sumProofAmounts helper; renames token.decode to token.decodeMeta; adds i18n `trying_again` key and translations; adds wallet store tests for counter and melt flows.\r\n\r\n## NOTES\r\n\r\n- Cashu-TS requires Node >=22.4.0 for full websocket support. Engine and CI updated to reflect this\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n\r\n- [x] Mint sats via Lightning invoice\r\n- [x] Send/receive Cashu tokens (swap, redeem + trusted mint paths)\r\n- [x] Pay Lightning invoice (melt)\r\n- [x] Kill tab during melt, reopen — no \"outputs already signed\" error\r\n- [x] Multi-mint swap\r\n- [x] Restore wallet from mnemonic — counter recovery\r\n- [x] P2PK locked send/receive\r\n- [x] npm test passes",
